    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Event Processing — Main Router\n\n**Webhook**: `POST /webhook/event-processing`\n\nThis workflow receives ALL events from Nerva API and routes them:\n- `order.created` → COD check → send WhatsApp confirmation\n- `order.confirmed` → address verification flow\n- `ndr.created` → NDR rescue flow\n- Other → logged\n\n### Setup Required\n1. Replace `x-api-key` with your actual workspace API key\n2. Create WhatsApp templates in MSG91 dashboard\n3. Activate this workflow before testing",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1001-4000-8000-000000000099",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
